    <string name="privacy_title">Lekunutu le POPIA</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">Ri-magwinya ke app ya ho odara esale pele lebenkeleng la Rosebank College, Bloemfontein. Leqephe lena le hlalosa seo re se bolokang ka wena le hore hobaneng, jwalo ka ha Molao wa Tshireletso ya Tlhahisoleseding ya Motho o re kopa.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_what">Seo re se bolokang</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_what">Lebitso la hao, aterese ya imeile le nomoro ya moithuti, hore basebetsi ba fumane odara ya hao lebenkeleng. Diodara tsa hao, seo se neng se le ho tsona, le hore o di latile neng. Tjhelete ya sepatjhe sa hao le tlaleho ya tjhelete e kentsweng le e lefilweng. Ha o bula ditsebiso, letshwao la sesebediswa hore re o tsebise ha odara ya hao e lokile.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_why">Hobaneng</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_why">Ho amohela odara ya hao, ho o lefisa tjhelete e nepahetseng, ho fa motho ya nepahetseng dijo tse nepahetseng, le ho thusa lebenkele ho rera setoko. Ha ho se seng.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_cards">Tefo ka karata</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_cards">Tjhelete e kenngwa mochining wa dikarata wa lebenkele, o leng wa banka mme o arohane. Ha ho nomoro ya karata e kileng ya fihla app ena.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_who">Ke mang ya e bonang</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_who">Wena o bona akhaonto ya hao. Basebetsi ba lebenkele ba bona diodara, mabitso le dinomoro tsa baithuti hore ba o sebeletse, le tjhelete eo ba e kenyang dipatjheng. Ha ho motho e mong. Ha ho letho le rekiswang kapa le arolelanwang.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_long">Re e boloka nako e kae</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_long">Akhaonto ya hao le nalane ya diodara di dula ha o ntse o sebedisa lebenkele. Kopa basebetsi ho tlosa akhaonto ya hao mme re e hlakola, hammoho le diodara tsa hao.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_rights">Ditokelo tsa hao</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_rights">O ka botsa hore re boloka eng ka wena, wa re kopa hore re e lokise, kapa re e hlakole. Bua le lebenkele kapa o romele imeile atereseng e boting ba ditsebiso ba kholeche.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h_security">Tshireletso</string>
    <string name="privacy_b_security">Phasewete ya hao e patwa ke mofani wa rona wa ho kena mme ha e bolokwe ke app. Tlhahisoleseding yohle e kwahetswe. Database e hana ho bontsha moithuti e mong tlhahisoleseding ya moithuti e mong.</string>

